1
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:12,530
♪Mighty winds carry me to the heavens♪

2
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,700
♪On a wild steed,
I sing, smiling at the mortal world♪

3
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:18,530
♪Then the cold night veils the stars♪

4
00:00:18,750 --> 00:00:21,710
♪I fall to the depths, yet walk alone♪

5
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,050
♪I brave countless snowy peaks♪

6
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,270
♪Your lingering warmth still fills
my palm♪

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,070
♪Though frost and snow may bar my way♪

8
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:35,940
♪The light in my eyes will never fade♪

9
00:00:36,290 --> 00:00:39,410
♪With a sword that cleaves the clouds♪

10
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:42,760
♪With a heart as firm as stone♪

11
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:45,680
♪Through all I've endured,
I have no regrets♪

12
00:00:45,960 --> 00:00:49,010
♪I'm still the boy I once was♪

13
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,860
=Sword God=

14
00:00:59,140 --> 00:01:00,380
=Episode 25=

15
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:02,350
(Auspicious Omens)
Elder Wang!

16
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,350
Oh, my!

17
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,480
Zhao Feiyang actually struck Elder Wang
with a single whip...

18
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,400
He reduced him to dust!

19
00:01:10,950 --> 00:01:12,150
That's terrifying!

20
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:14,510
Elder Wang was at Stage 6
of the Minor Perfection Realm.

21
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:16,560
He couldn't even fight back.

22
00:01:16,870 --> 00:01:17,560
Zhao Feiyang,

23
00:01:17,870 --> 00:01:20,120
what is your cultivation level now?

24
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:23,510
This...

25
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,480
What?

26
00:01:27,580 --> 00:01:27,820
(Minor Perfection Realm, Stage 9)

27
00:01:28,760 --> 00:01:29,760
At such a young age,

28
00:01:30,070 --> 00:01:32,640
he's already at Stage 9
of the Minor Perfection Realm!

29
00:01:33,230 --> 00:01:34,200
That's the limit

30
00:01:34,430 --> 00:01:37,280
for an ordinary cultivator

31
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:39,840
without extraordinary fortune.

32
00:01:40,920 --> 00:01:42,870
Sect Master Wang, are you blind?

33
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,070
You actually kicked out

34
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:45,310
such a talented disciple,

35
00:01:45,510 --> 00:01:46,920
making him resent you.

36
00:01:47,150 --> 00:01:48,680
Now he's taking it out on us too!

37
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,400
This... this...

38
00:01:49,950 --> 00:01:51,040
We honestly had no clue

39
00:01:51,150 --> 00:01:52,400
when he got this strong.

40
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,710
I see.

41
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:55,070
(Virtue Shines Through)
Zhao Feiyang,

42
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:57,430
I admit I misjudged you before.

43
00:01:58,070 --> 00:01:58,640
However,

44
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,950
do you think your current cultivation

45
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,350
puts you above everyone else?

46
00:02:03,590 --> 00:02:04,560
I'm not arrogant.

47
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:06,640
You're not arrogant?

48
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,910
Then how dare you go up against

49
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:11,190
the entire Southern Domain alone?

50
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,400
I'm not arrogant,

51
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,240
but I am confident.

52
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:16,310
Our agreement still stands.

53
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:17,360
If you submit to me,

54
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,870
I'll find a way to secure

55
00:02:19,120 --> 00:02:20,080
the sect's future resources.

56
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,750
If you want to take me down, go ahead.

57
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,470
Fine. Fine.

58
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:28,150
Quite confident.

59
00:02:29,430 --> 00:02:32,400
Then let me see what you've got.

60
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:40,520
Sect Master, what are you doing?

61
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:41,680
Sect Master, stop!

62
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:46,400
Break!

63
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,800
(So this is the spiritual pressure
of the Greater Perfection Realm?)

64
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,520
(I wonder if fighting Wang Feng)

65
00:02:53,190 --> 00:02:54,000
(could give me a chance)

66
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,520
(to break through to
the Greater Perfection Realm.)

67
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:01,750
He's forcing a breakthrough.

68
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,400
(Lucky I didn't cross him earlier.)

69
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:06,870
(Even if we'd joined forces
with Tianwu Sect,)

70
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:09,400
(we still might not have been
a match for the Heavenly Sword Sect.)

71
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,840
He's been stuck for a century at
Greater Perfection Realm, Stage 9.

72
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,520
I thought he'd reached his limit.

73
00:03:14,870 --> 00:03:16,800
I never thought he could actually
break through.

74
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:18,710
It's just a shame...

75
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:19,520
Sect Master,

76
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,310
why did you have to do this?

77
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:23,470
Spiritual energy is scarce
on Shenwu Continent.

78
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,080
We should lie low

79
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,360
and build our strength for decades

80
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,840
before attempting a breakthrough.

81
00:03:28,030 --> 00:03:28,910
You've broken through,

82
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:30,310
but if you can't sustain the new realm,

83
00:03:30,470 --> 00:03:31,310
you'll fall back down,

84
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,840
and never break through again.

85
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,750
I've cultivated for over 300 years.

86
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,910
If I can't even intimidate
a little upstart,

87
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:41,800
how could I show my face

88
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,560
in the Southern Domain?

89
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,150
Let's take him together.

90
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:48,360
We don't need to.

91
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,840
The gap between
the Minor Perfection Realm

92
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:52,120
and the Greater Perfection Realm
is simply too great.

93
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:53,360
(Besides,)

94
00:03:53,750 --> 00:03:55,190
(once Wang Feng defeats Zhao Feiyang,)

95
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,870
(his realm will inevitably drop.)

96
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:58,280
(That's our chance)

97
00:03:58,400 --> 00:03:59,960
(to suppress the remaining forces
of the Heavenly Sword Sect)

98
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,280
(and rule the Southern Domain.)

99
00:04:02,470 --> 00:04:03,400
In that case,

100
00:04:03,750 --> 00:04:05,560
we'll leave this kid to you.

101
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,240
We'll stand guard for you.

102
00:04:07,590 --> 00:04:08,080
Sect Master,

103
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:09,240
should we...

104
00:04:09,590 --> 00:04:11,240
Just wait and see.

105
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,870
Heaven-Splitting Strike!

106
00:04:51,630 --> 00:04:54,240
Seems he wasn't just boasting after all.

107
00:04:54,510 --> 00:04:55,800
If Zhao Feiyang keeps

108
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,000
biding his time for decades,

109
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,240
I'm afraid no one in
Shenwu Continent's Southern Domain

110
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:01,120
could stand against him.

111
00:05:01,390 --> 00:05:02,190
I heard

112
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:04,190
he reached this level
in just over a year

113
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,120
after starting over.

114
00:05:06,510 --> 00:05:07,800
Forget giving him decades,

115
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,680
even a few years would be terrifying.

116
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,040
Am I seeing this right?

117
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:12,680
Zhao Feiyang

118
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:15,070
has held his own against Sect Master
this long?

119
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,920
Sect Master is in
the Greater Perfection Realm!

120
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,480
Zhao Feiyang's swordsmanship
is incredible,

121
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:20,000
stronger than yours or mine,

122
00:05:20,630 --> 00:05:21,630
even Sect Master's!

123
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,800
Just what has he been through
this past year?

124
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:24,680
No one knows.

125
00:05:25,310 --> 00:05:26,510
But don't worry too much.

126
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:27,360
Why not?

127
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,630
The gap in cultivation realms

128
00:05:29,190 --> 00:05:30,600
can't be made up by swordsmanship.

129
00:05:31,750 --> 00:05:32,390
That's true.

130
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,360
Myriad Forms!

131
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,390
Zhao Feiyang,

132
00:05:56,750 --> 00:05:59,160
your swordsmanship is indeed formidable.

133
00:05:59,430 --> 00:06:01,190
Too bad you ran into me.

134
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:02,040
The gap in realms

135
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,750
is an uncrossable chasm!

136
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:05,800
I'll kill you today!

137
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,070
Then stop wasting words.

138
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,000
Come at me.

139
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:10,510
Zhao Feiyang,

140
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,800
why must you be so stubborn?

141
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:13,000
You could have lived.

142
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,630
You could have had a bright future.

143
00:06:14,800 --> 00:06:15,430
But now...

144
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:21,310
Forget it.

145
00:06:21,830 --> 00:06:22,510
Chen Qiushui,

146
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:25,000
he's only a minor ripple in your life.

147
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:26,950
Let him go.

148
00:06:31,830 --> 00:06:32,950
Jiang Cheng is dead.

149
00:06:33,310 --> 00:06:34,950
The Three Great Sects have fallen.

150
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:36,870
I must hurry back

151
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,160
to report to Tianxuan Kingdom's emperor.

152
00:06:39,390 --> 00:06:40,190
Now might be

153
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:42,630
the best time to unify
the Southern Domain.

154
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:53,360
(I never thought Wang Feng's
Myriad Forms Sword Art)

155
00:06:53,510 --> 00:06:54,680
(had reached its peak.)

156
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:56,240
(Once he uses his final move,)

157
00:06:56,600 --> 00:06:58,430
(Zhao Feiyang may be doomed.)

158
00:06:58,630 --> 00:07:00,190
(Wang Feng forced his breakthrough)

159
00:07:00,390 --> 00:07:01,830
(and spent so much spiritual energy.)

160
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,360
(His realm is bound to fall.)

161
00:07:03,830 --> 00:07:05,070
(Our chance has come.)

162
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:19,950
Stop struggling in vain.

163
00:07:23,750 --> 00:07:24,920
It's not over yet.

164
00:07:25,870 --> 00:07:27,070
Still talking tough?

165
00:07:27,630 --> 00:07:29,630
It's been a century since I last fought.

166
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:31,630
I've had my fun.

167
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:32,870
But...

168
00:07:32,950 --> 00:07:34,240
it's time to end this!

169
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:39,430
Myriad Forms Return to One!

170
00:07:40,310 --> 00:07:42,070
Heavenburn Sword Shadow!

171
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:55,310
Sect Master!

172
00:07:55,630 --> 00:07:56,360
Are you all right?

173
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,040
His meridians are in chaos.

174
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,600
Sect Master, take this.

175
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:08,360
My cultivation is already ruined.

176
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,800
Keep it.

177
00:08:10,270 --> 00:08:11,680
Sect Master, please take it.

178
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,120
Our sect still needs you.

179
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,310
Sect Master,

180
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,510
let's return to the sect.

181
00:08:24,890 --> 00:08:27,240
(Virtue Shines Through;
Lingering Fragrance)

182
00:08:30,390 --> 00:08:31,430
What is the meaning of this?

183
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,080
Why are you stopping us?

184
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,860
(Virtue Shines Through)

185
00:08:35,860 --> 00:08:38,000
(Auspicious Omens)

186
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,030
Just as I thought.

187
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:40,630
Things have come to this

188
00:08:40,790 --> 00:08:41,750
in the Southern Domain.

189
00:08:42,240 --> 00:08:44,080
If the three of us don't join forces,

190
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,510
Tianxuan Kingdom and Nanyuan Kingdom

191
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:49,030
will sweep through all our sects.

192
00:08:49,550 --> 00:08:50,870
Then no sect will survive

193
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:53,120
in the Southern Domain.

194
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,910
Have the Heavenly Sword Sect
merge with us.

195
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,390
Protectors or elders,

196
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,200
pick your positions.

197
00:09:00,030 --> 00:09:01,550
You'll still be my honored guests.

198
00:09:01,670 --> 00:09:03,510
If you want to swallow us up,

199
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:05,600
just say so.

200
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,840
No need for all these excuses.

201
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,960
Sect Master Wang, if you say so,

202
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,030
then so be it.

203
00:09:11,750 --> 00:09:12,360
Or...

204
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,270
do you even have a choice?

205
00:09:16,790 --> 00:09:18,960
We're only trying to help.

206
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,840
We hope everyone in your sect

207
00:09:22,630 --> 00:09:24,000
can see the situation clearly.

208
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:26,840
What if I refuse?

209
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,030
Then we'll have to
wipe out all your leaders.

210
00:09:30,270 --> 00:09:31,030
Then,

211
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,720
Liang Long and I

212
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:35,030
will be the only ones left standing
in the Southern Domain.

213
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,120
Elder Deng, Elder Murong,

214
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:45,840
heed my orders.

215
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,270
What are your orders, Sect Master?

216
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,150
Please speak, Sect Master.

217
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:50,870
Now, I am expelling you two

218
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:52,910
from the Heavenly Sword Sect.

219
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:53,790
Sect Master!

220
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,440
Sect Master!

221
00:09:54,600 --> 00:09:55,440
Join them.

222
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:56,910
No more discussion.

223
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,320
I've lost.

224
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:00,270
I've lost completely.

225
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:03,150
But I won't drag you down with me.

226
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,630
If you refuse,

227
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:07,720
I'll sever my own meridians!

228
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:09,630
Sect Master...

229
00:10:10,510 --> 00:10:12,000
Thank you for understanding,
Sect Master Wang.

230
00:10:12,720 --> 00:10:14,200
I failed as sect master

231
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:16,670
and let down our past patriarchs.

232
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:20,000
Let me stay with the sect

233
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:22,000
to the very end!

234
00:10:25,910 --> 00:10:27,200
We've shared some history.

235
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:31,360
I'll make your final moments
less painful!

236
00:11:20,260 --> 00:11:24,050
♪I once stood on high,
drawing spiritual energy into my blade♪

237
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:26,450
♪I laughed, pointing at the stars,
young and fearless♪

238
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:30,570
♪Then came my fall,
with frost and snow on my shoulders♪

239
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:35,130
♪My Dao foundation was damaged,
yet my Dao heart never wavered♪

240
00:11:35,300 --> 00:11:38,450
♪I crossed countless peaks
to find my answer again♪

241
00:11:39,290 --> 00:11:41,960
♪Through endless trials,
my Nascent Soul came♪

242
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:45,580
♪Heaven and earth my furnace,
I rose from the flame♪

243
00:11:45,660 --> 00:11:49,390
♪No sword in hand,
yet numberless blades obey♪

244
00:11:50,260 --> 00:11:53,430
♪I seek the Dao beyond the clouds♪

245
00:11:53,700 --> 00:11:56,820
♪Unafraid of countless trials♪

246
00:11:57,620 --> 00:12:00,140
♪With this flesh and soul♪

247
00:12:00,460 --> 00:12:03,690
♪I shall forge a new age♪

248
00:12:03,900 --> 00:12:06,770
♪Let thunder and fire crown me♪

249
00:12:07,140 --> 00:12:10,230
♪Let wind and clouds heed me♪

250
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:13,090
♪At cultivation's peak♪

251
00:12:13,100 --> 00:12:16,450
♪My first resolve remains unchanged♪

252
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:19,930
♪The sun and moon turn♪

253
00:12:19,930 --> 00:12:23,450
♪I hear the Great Dao ring♪

254
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:30,430
♪I am the undying flame♪

255
00:12:31,420 --> 00:12:36,090
♪Looking back when dust settles♪

256
00:12:36,350 --> 00:12:39,450
♪At last I see, immortality♪

257
00:12:39,900 --> 00:12:44,590
♪Lives in your smiles♪
